        "summary": "Cooperatively coupled 3d/4f cluster with antiferromagnetic Fe–Fe and weak ferromagnetic Dy–Dy interactions in the 2Fe:2Dy:2Fe core; SMM behavior. χT at RT is 42.0 cm3 K mol−1 (expected 45.8). χT decreases to 26.3 cm3 K mol−1 at 8 K then rises to 28.8 at 1.8 K. Magnetization does not saturate at 7 T. AC data give Ueff = 21.4 K and τ0 = 2.7×10−8 s; Cole–Cole α = 0.04–0.13 (2.4–2.9 K). Estimated J(Fe–Fe) ≈ −9.2 cm−1.",
